cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "MedXAI: Multi-Modal Medical Explainable AI + Wellness Atlas"
message: "If you use MedXAI in academic work, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Soni
    given-names: Krish
    email: sonikrish2248@gmail.com
repository-code: "https://github.com/krish2248/medxai"
license: MIT
version: 0.0.1
date-released: "2026-05-10"
abstract: >
  MedXAI is a multi-modal medical AI portfolio system that pairs a curated set
  of imaging, tabular, and lab-report models with quantitative explainability
  (Grad-CAM, Integrated Gradients, SHAP, LIME, DiCE) and a human-curated,
  citation-backed Wellness Atlas of preventive-health knowledge. It is a
  research and educational artifact, not a medical device.
keywords:
  - medical-imaging
  - explainable-ai
  - xai
  - radiology
  - tabular-ml
  - reproducibility
